Patches for the vendor blob repo that this tree expects.
Apply from the ROM source root:

    git -C vendor/xiaomi/houji apply $(pwd)/device/xiaomi/houji/vendor-patches/houji-drop-tsskinbeautifier.patch

    # Google SIM Manager gms build (presigned + preprocessed), apply in order:
    git -C vendor/xiaomi/houji apply $(pwd)/device/xiaomi/houji/vendor-patches/houji-euiccgoogle-gms-1-apk.patch
    git -C vendor/xiaomi/houji apply $(pwd)/device/xiaomi/houji/vendor-patches/houji-euiccgoogle-gms-2-preprocessed.patch
